COMP 2404 Assignment 3 - Telco Message Manager

Author
Jackson Lafrance

Purpose
This program manages subscribers and text messages for a telephone company. It stores subscribers in an array collection and messages in a doubly linked list. The program can print messages, print subscribers and order subscribers by message activity

Source Files
Control.cc     Implements the Control class
Date.cc        Implements the Date class
ExternMsg.cc   Implements the ExternMsg class
InternMsg.cc   Implements the InternMsg class
Msg.cc         Implements the Msg class
MsgList.cc     Implements the MsgList class
SubArray.cc    Implements the SubArray class
Subscriber.cc  Implements the Subscriber class
Telco.cc       Implements the Telco class
Time.cc        Implements the Time class
View.cc        Implements the View class
main.cc        Implements main() and selectionSort()

Header Files
Control.h      Declares the Control class
Date.h         Declares the Date class
defs.h         Declares constants, enums, and selectionSort()
ExternMsg.h    Declares the ExternMsg class
InternMsg.h    Declares the InternMsg class
Msg.h          Declares the Msg class
MsgList.h      Declares the MsgList class
SubArray.h     Declares the SubArray class
Subscriber.h   Declares the Subscriber class
Telco.h        Declares the Telco class
Time.h         Declares the Time class
View.h         Declares the View class

Data Files
None

Compilation
In the directory containing the program files run:

    make

Launching
Run the program with:

    ./a3

Cleaning
To remove the object files and executable run:

    make clean
